== 12.2-dev ==
* Bug fix on MDPPTriggerControl GUI
* Provide mvlcgenerate - transform daqconfig.tcl files to MVLC readout yaml.
* Provide mvlc_xlmload - use mvlc to load XLM FPGA modules.
* Provide workarounds for VMUSB bugs in recent firmware versions.
    *  A prompt busy is guaranteed by using delay stack elements rather than the trigger delay.
    *  Busy resting state is active by reprogramming it to be the inverse of end of event as the run ends e.g.
    *  End of event is forced by appending a marker to the readout stack which is then transparently discarded
by COutputThread (nummap_chunk() issue fixed)
* Implenenting sample data taking in MDPP-16/32 modules
* Updating MDPP-16/32 documentation
* Updated MADC-32 for indpendent bank operation
* Fix for window configuration in V1x90 digitizers
* Resolve inconsistent behavior between VX2740 readout and unpacker handling of fail bit
* Add --enable-rust-tools to configuration options.  If enabled:
    *  Brings in ringmaster, portmanager, ring2stdout Rust programs from github
    *  Builds those external programs and installs them in @bindir@/rust
    *  Builds rust programs in main/rust_tools and installs them in @bindir@/rust
* Add statistics server for ringbuffer throughput and aggregate transfer. (rust_tools/ring_monitor)
    * statsview python script can view the statistics it accumulates utilities/statsview), and logs it into a statistics database file.
    * statsplot python script can view the time evoluton of ring statistics
      logged by ring_monitor into an sqlite3 database file.
    
* Issue # 251 - add statistics to the python managed environment control panel
* Build docs for parallel processing framework
* Fix issue #380- compile fails if not MPI due to missing #include <iostream>
* Fix issue #385 - glom uses buffered fragment reader
* Make CFragmentHandler predicate classes operator() const and take const ref as parameter for compliance with some handy STL algos for future fragment handler development
* Build docs for swtrigger
